    dcterms:description "Low-Cost MRO (MRO-L) site description for the Aegean aircraft-maintenance pilot: the Aircraft Maintenance process it performs and its capacity/cost characteristics (Daily Workhours Per Bay, Effective Workhour Charge Rate, Hours Per Shift, Net Schedulable Bays, Operating Days Per Week, Reserved AOG Bays, Shifts Per Day, Technicians Per Bay, Total Bays, Workhour Rate Multiplier), with the shared characteristic-type definitions (name, unit, notes)."@en ;
